{"id":"79fdba64c2b7076a4d62ee67a08520f02616d72c","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"79fdba64c2b7076a4d62ee67a08520f02616d72c","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/modules-dir-outside-the-project.md","lines":["@@ -2,4 +2,4 @@"," \"pacquet\": patch"," ---"," ","-Fixed installs in a workspace whose `modulesDir` is an absolute path or starts with `..`. A fresh install no longer puts the dependencies of workspace projects outside the workspace. A frozen install now links the root project's dependencies into the configured directory. pnpm now also removes a dependency you remove from such a directory [pnpm/tasks#285](https://github.com/pnpm/tasks/issues/285).","+Fixed installs in a workspace whose `modulesDir` is an absolute path or starts with `..`. A fresh install no longer puts the dependencies of workspace projects outside the workspace. A frozen install now links the root project's dependencies into the configured directory. pnpm now also removes a dependency you remove from such a directory. With `excludeLinksFromLockfile`, the root project's linked dependencies now go to the configured directory. The root project's lifecycle scripts now find the commands of its dependencies. The `loaded` node linker now puts the root project's commands in that directory's `.bin` [pnpm/tasks#285](https://github.com/pnpm/tasks/issues/285)."],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/exec.rs","lines":["@@ -315,7 +315,7 @@ fn project_extra_env(","     config.prepend_project_node_path::<pnpm_config::Host>(","         &mut env,","         project,","-        &config.modules_dir_name_for(project, project_name),","+        &project.join(config.modules_dir_name_for(project, project_name)),","     );","     env"," }"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/run/execution.rs","lines":["@@ -326,7 +326,7 @@ fn project_extra_env(ctx: &RunContext<'_>) -> HashMap<String, String> {","     ctx.config.pre